{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#card-zh", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 是面向 macOS 的 DeepSeek Harness Web 启动器，通过 shell 脚本调用 dsh web，并提供前台与后台启动、状态查看和停止功能。启动前会探测本机端口，服务就绪后自动打开浏览器；DSH 已运行时不会重复启动。后台模式把日志写入 ~/.dsh/web.log，DSH_PORT 可覆盖默认端口 3080。仓库还提供构建 Dock 常驻应用的脚本，适合希望用命令行或桌面入口管理本机 DSH Web 的用户。它把这些操作集中在一个入口，减少手工启动服务和确认服务状态的步骤。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:19-24", "scripts/start-dsh.sh:29-91", "scripts/build-dsh-app.sh:1-40"]}
{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#card-en", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-start launches DeepSeek Harness Web on macOS. It starts dsh web in foreground or background, checks status, stops the service, and opens the browser when ready. It avoids duplicate starts. Background logs go to ~/.dsh/web.log; DSH_PORT changes port 3080. An optional script builds a Dock app.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:19-24", "scripts/start-dsh.sh:29-91", "scripts/build-dsh-app.sh:1-40"]}
