{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#feature-1", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 的功能「前台启动」：运行 dsh-start 时会在当前终端启动 dsh web，显示服务输出；按 Ctrl+C 可停止。启动后脚本轮询就绪状态并打开本机页面。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:76-91"]}
{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#feature-2", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 的功能「后台启动」：运行 dsh-start -d 会用 nohup 在后台启动 dsh web，并将输出追加到 ~/.dsh/web.log；最多等待 90 秒探测服务就绪。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:60-73"]}
{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#feature-3", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 的功能「状态查询」：运行 dsh-start status 会探测配置端口的本机 Web 地址，并输出服务运行状态及地址。默认端口为 3080，可通过 DSH_PORT 覆盖。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:19-24", "scripts/start-dsh.sh:39-45"]}
{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#feature-4", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 的功能「停止服务」：运行 dsh-start stop 会查找监听配置端口的进程并尝试结束它；若端口没有监听进程则提示当前未运行。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["scripts/start-dsh.sh:29-37"]}
{"unit_id": "zhengjy01__dsh-start#feature-5", "repo": "zhengjy01/dsh-start", "commit": "e4027de077ea569bfbb044acfc2c46cf1ed3259f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-start 的功能「构建 Dock 应用」：运行 dsh-start --build-app 会转交给构建脚本，在 macOS 上生成常驻 DSH.app，并安装图标、设置应用信息和注册 LaunchServices。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["bin/dsh-start:1-12", "scripts/start-dsh.sh:47-50", "scripts/build-dsh-app.sh:1-40"]}
